Z||000008||Jimmy||12-01-2001||02:37 PM||||When I went drag racing this summer I noticed a guy looking over my car in the lanes.  I walked up to him and he introduced himself and said that he has a fast Fiero too.  I told him mine was a V8 at which point he began to grin and said his was too.  Man was I surprised when he told me about his car.  Unfortunately he did not have his Fiero there that day.  He was dragging a HEAVILY modified Vette that was runnig 10s I believe.  He told me he is in the process of redoing his Fiero so that it will run high 8s.  I believe he was in the mid 9s with the setup pictured above.  Can't wait to see him at the the strip again next year.  I am in the process up developing more power from my small block also as we speak.<P>Jim<P>87 GT T-TOP V8<BR>87 GT||||reg||1
